! Applied repairs, not full running-config
configure terminal
no username R11
username R1 password cisco
username R3 password cisco
interface g0/1
 ip address 209.165.200.161 255.255.255.224
interface s0/0/0
 no shutdown
interface s0/0/1
 encapsulation ppp
 ppp authentication chap
 no shutdown
end
write memory
clear ip ospf process
yes
configure terminal
router ospf 1
 no default-information originate
 default-information originate
end
write memory
